 "script": [
  {
   "cue": [
    "title"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "小朋友们好！今天的单词，和一年里最开心的一天有关。"
    },
    {
     "en": "birthday"
    },
    {
     "zh": "生日。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "map",
    "show:birthday",
    "focus:birthday"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "你出生的那一天，每年都会再来一次，它就是你的生日："
    },
    {
     "en": "birthday"
    },
    {
     "en": "Happy birthday!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:party",
    "edge:birthday>party",
    "focus:party"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "过生日，最开心的就是开一个热热闹闹的聚会："
    },
    {
     "en": "party"
    },
    {
     "en": "a birthday party"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:cake",
    "edge:party>cake",
    "focus:cake"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "聚会上，怎么能少了甜甜的蛋糕？蛋糕，英语是"
    },
    {
     "en": "cake"
    },
    {
     "en": "a big cake"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:candle",
    "edge:cake>candle",
    "focus:candle"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "蛋糕上要插上蜡烛，几岁就插几根："
    },
    {
     "en": "candle"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:match",
    "edge:match>candle",
    "focus:match"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "蜡烛要点亮，就要用到火柴："
    },
    {
     "en": "match"
    },
    {
     "zh": "火柴有危险，一定要请大人帮忙点哦。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:wish",
    "focus:wish,candle"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "蜡烛亮起来啦！先闭上眼睛，在心里许一个愿望："
    },
    {
     "en": "wish"
    },
    {
     "en": "Make a wish!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:blow",
    "edge:candle>blow",
    "edge:wish>blow",
    "focus:blow"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "许完愿，深吸一口气，呼——把蜡烛吹灭！吹，英语是"
    },
    {
     "en": "blow"
    },
    {
     "en": "Blow out the candles!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:balloon",
    "edge:blow>balloon",
    "focus:balloon"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "嘴巴还能吹什么？对啦，吹气球！气球是"
    },
    {
     "en": "balloon"
    },
    {
     "zh": "小提示：它中间有两个字母 l，还有两个字母 o。"
    },
    {
     "en": "Let's blow up a balloon!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:present",
    "edge:party>present",
    "focus:present"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "朋友们来参加聚会，还会带来礼物："
    },
    {
     "en": "present"
    },
    {
     "zh": "礼物还有一个更短的说法，叫",
     "cue": [
      "alt:present"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "gift"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:give",
    "edge:present>give",
    "focus:give"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "把礼物送给别人，是给："
    },
    {
     "en": "give"
    },
    {
     "en": "I give you a present."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:get",
    "edge:present>get",
    "focus:get"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "收到别人送来的礼物，就是得到："
    },
    {
     "en": "get"
    },
    {
     "en": "I get a present!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:for",
    "edge:give>for",
    "focus:for"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "这份礼物，是专门为你准备的。说给谁的、为了谁，就用这个小小的词："
    },
    {
     "en": "for"
    },
    {
     "en": "This present is for you."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "focus:none"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "生日聚会上，很多东西都不止一个。一个变成很多个，后面加上字母 s 就好啦。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "focus:candle"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "en": "candle",
     "cue": [
      "focus:candle"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "candles",
     "cue": [
      "plural:candle"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "balloon",
     "cue": [
      "focus:balloon"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "balloons",
     "cue": [
      "plural:balloon"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "present",
     "cue": [
      "focus:present"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "presents",
     "cue": [
      "plural:present"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "focus:give,get"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "给和得到，正好是一对。我送出去，是"
    },
    {
     "en": "give",
     "cue": [
      "focus:give"
     ]
    },
    {
     "zh": "我收进来，是",
     "cue": [
      "focus:get"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "get"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "focus:birthday"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "最后，我们一起来唱一句生日歌吧！"
    },
    {
     "en": "Happy birthday to you!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "focus:none"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "最后，跟着我把今天的单词再读一遍吧！"
    }
